    "Live Activities are off for Waffi, so your order will not show on the lock screen. Keep this screen open, or turn them on in Settings.": {
      "comment": "App Clip: note when Live Activities are switched off",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الأنشطة المباشرة متوقفة لـ Waffi، لذا لن يظهر طلبك على شاشة القفل. أبقِ هذه الشاشة مفتوحة أو فعّلها من الإعدادات."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live Activities are off for Waffi, so your order will not show on the lock screen. Keep this screen open, or turn them on in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
